    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305940/extras/16063ebdbc5a575c4bd13303945cede6.avif?t=1747960227\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INTRODUCTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Pedaling in the Sauerkraut&quot; is a visual novel with a linear storyline</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yu, a middle school student, spent his days studying at his childhood friend's house as the test period approached.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He secretly harbored feelings of love for her, and studying together was part of his effort to become her equal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, sensing something unsettling about her, he began to search for the cause and soon found himself stepping into the world of the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid emotions tangled with love, equality, and messianic delusions, he spirals out of control\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VIDEO POLICY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no specific restrictions on game streaming or broadcasting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305940/extras/16063ebdbc5a575c4bd13303945cede6.avif?t=1747960227\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INTRODUCTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Pedaling in the Sauerkraut&quot; is a visual novel with a linear storyline</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yu, a middle school student, spent his days studying at his childhood friend's house as the test period approached.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He secretly harbored feelings of love for her, and studying together was part of his effort to become her equal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, sensing something unsettling about her, he began to search for the cause and soon found himself stepping into the world of the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid emotions tangled with love, equality, and messianic delusions, he spirals out of control\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VIDEO POLICY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no specific restrictions on game streaming or broadcasting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
